msgid "KDC Address"
msgstr "KDC manzili"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:522
msgid ""
"Optional. A domain controller name or IP address, a tcp:// or udp:// "
"address, or an https:// KDC proxy URL. Leave empty to find it automatically. "
"The External client uses only an https://…/KdcProxy proxy and otherwise "
"follows the system Kerberos configuration."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy. Domen kontrolleri nomi yoki IP manzili, tcp:// yoki udp:// "
"manzili, yoki https:// KDC proksi URL manzili. Avtomatik topish uchun boʻsh "
"qoldiring. Tashqi mijoz faqat https://…/KdcProxy proksisidan foydalanadi va "
"aks holda tizim Kerberos konfiguratsiyasiga amal qiladi."

